// Service_Storage — Data Storage Layer (layanan, tanpa alat)
// Render manual: https://app.eraser.io > Diagram-as-code (cloud architecture).
//   Buat kanvas BARU bernama "Service_Storage".
// Ekspor PNG ke materials/reports/figures/Service_Storage.png
// Acuan: fig:service-storage (Subbab IV.2.3, subsec:rincian-kelompok);
//   rincian bebas-tool kelompok baris 3 Tabel layanan_industri, komponen verbatim.
// Sumber edge: najafabadi2024analysis (dataset repository menyimpan dataset
//   pelatihan), munappy2020adhoc (data storage pada kelompok teknologi data),
//   jain2025integrating (data versioning pada tanggung jawab data engineering).
// Ikon generik (bebas-tool), nama diverifikasi docs.eraser.io/docs/icons 2026-07-11.
// Rendering WAJIB horizontal (direction right), tanpa \rotatebox pada LaTeX.

direction right

// Produsen data terkelola (batas)
Data Ingestion and Processing Layer [icon: download, color: orange, label: "Data Ingestion and Processing Layer"]

Data Storage Layer [icon: database, color: green] {
  data storage [icon: database]
  dataset repository [icon: folder]
  data versioning [icon: history]
}

// Konsumen (batas)
Feature Service Layer [icon: package, color: green, label: "Feature Service Layer"]
Model Lifecycle Layer [icon: refresh-cw, color: purple, label: "Model Lifecycle Layer"]

// Data mendarat, dikurasi, dan diversikan (najafabadi2024analysis, jain2025integrating)
Data Ingestion and Processing Layer > data storage: data terkelola mendarat
data storage > dataset repository: kurasi dataset
dataset repository > data versioning: riwayat versi dataset

// Keluaran penyimpanan
data storage > Feature Service Layer: sumber fitur
dataset repository > Model Lifecycle Layer: dataset pelatihan
